# LF in every checkout, also on Windows with core.autocrlf (Windows port): golden files, catalogs,
# tokens and scripts are compared or parsed byte for byte. Git detects binaries (PNG snapshots, icons).
* text=auto eol=lf
# The vendored ASIO SDK stays byte-identical to upstream (CRLF; see vendor/asio-sdk/VENDORED.md).
vendor/asio-sdk/** -text

# Byte-identical upstream DSP sources, including their original whitespace.
vendor/signalsmith-stretch/** -text -whitespace
